# Changelog entries

When the user asks to add a changelog entry:

1. Edit `frontend/src/components/changelog/changelogEntries.ts`
2. **Prepend** a new object to `CHANGELOG_ENTRIES` (newest first)
3. Use this shape:

```ts
{
  id: 'semver-or-date-slug',   // unique, e.g. '0-3-0'
  title: 'Short headline',
  date: 'Mon D, YYYY',         // e.g. 'Jun 12, 2026'
  tag: 'beta',                 // optional pill label
  paragraphs: ['One or more plain-text paragraphs.'],
}
```

4. **Do not** add emojis or image slots
5. UI lives in `ChangelogTimeline.tsx` (scroll-driven timeline) and `ChangelogPage.tsx` — do not change layout unless asked
6. Keep copy user-facing: what shipped and why it matters, not internal refactors
